    "updated_at": "2023-05-19T10:09:01Z",
    "body": "Fwiw, the newer `script-src-elem` and also `worker-src` (eg `script-src: none; worker-src https:`) probably also need to be considered in spec. With worker-src it should be impossible to register a worker anyway with script-src none but not sure how sure that's considered due to possible remaining service workers, etc.",
